"⟪k:0⟫Riding the moonlight’s current, his hand fell against my cheek.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It was much colder "
"than I had expected,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sa main accompagna le flux de la lune et atterrit sur ma joue.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Elle était bien plus "
"froide que je ne l’aurais cru,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E05F5ED4_80BB_4F67_9BDF_F9C180B1D998
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e02c1e31dd8712f844944b235b1f9ab8079f1b8af195d8ccee3c2b616fc4de73
