#: scenario5:scenario5_03433850_C291_4A13_9D33_EB97118F6FA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 47068e9fbec631f101e92909a76c66d1287e3aa75a8fafbb0492e7e570dd3707
#. default-sha256: e82e674e1c282c9d1efe8059455684ef8f0a55d4c96db676f25dd5d5eeec663a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_03433850_C291_4A13_9D33_EB97118F6FA8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As we drew closer, I could feel the warmth emanating from his body, and I’m sure he could "
"feel mine. ⟪k:1⟫The beating of my heart too.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫His breathing stopped for a moment, then he "
"gulped."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tandis qu’on se rapprochait, je pouvais sentir la chaleur émaner de son corps, et je suis "
"sûre qu’il pouvait sentir la mienne. ⟪k:1⟫Les battements de mon cœur aussi.⟪k:2⟫ Sa respiration "
"s’arrêta un moment, puis il déglutit."

