#: scenario5:scenario5_5830D3A1_ED90_4E29_A470_5E0F68FAD0F7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 881e92c81f7ad20f525c069904bdc7336f090ff960046ff5cb3ceb7a14425275
