msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5830D3A1_ED90_4E29_A470_5E0F68FAD0F7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was stunning. ⟪k:1⟫I had no measure of comparison, but I was certain the same sight of "
"any other woman in the world would not have had the same effect on me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elle était éblouissante. ⟪k:1⟫Je n’avais pas de moyens de comparaison mais si j’avais vu "
"n’importe quelle autre femme, ça n’aurait pas eu le même effet sur moi, j’en étais certain."

#: scenario5:scenario5_DD70090B_97AB_4162_B856_5740FC5490D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e629355847d1a4da07cb85229c5f4c15c909ce36287eb2b2854524bddc19351d
