msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Swollen, red-and-black gashes, still not healed after more than a year, defiled her white "
"flesh."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Des entailles enflées, rouges et noires, toujours visibles après plus d’un an, profanaient "
"sa peau blanche."

