msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As she had described for me, the lines were arranged to form letters carved into her skin."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Comme elle me l’avait décrit, les lignes étaient disposées pour former des lettres gravées "
"dans sa chair."

