#: scenario5:scenario5_02B8F237_E207_4C51_B8CF_7274CF68EF06
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 23aee4254e8f7d33e5662589541fb01eeda7e4d4bebf868fd94384c2bece302a
