#: scenario5:scenario5_631F0C07_5F95_460D_BBB4_AC2544FE3675
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bce54fa35b6cc75845dafa0363922dee72904bbcb285150fe034c98ab04db60f
#. default-sha256: 55699d70f7abde0f00f6aebb2e2ff2853620bc34e96238204dc4d3441871c613
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_631F0C07_5F95_460D_BBB4_AC2544FE3675"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I want you to be honest with me. ⟪k:1⟫If, hypothetically,⟪k:2⟫such a thing were possible, "
"would you want to curse him?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je veux que vous soyez honnête avec moi. ⟪k:1⟫En théorie,⟪k:2⟫si une telle chose était "
"possible, voudriez-vous le maudire ?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_40A4CAD5_9803_4131_9C9B_F403C9431437
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2e925e3e52cf74e7096b79fac846e59d688563c33efdd9596573600ab42461f5
#. default-sha256: ebb21936933edc25af45ccad571fa562ab9af1b0c5278b310dc6e8c72bd50888
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_40A4CAD5_9803_4131_9C9B_F403C9431437"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫...No, I would not want that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫...Non, ce n’est pas ce que je voudrais."

#: scenario5:scenario5_624A38E4_B8E8_4A96_8D5F_55C759B15018
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b7d6eb3634c470901a31a35be8c8c74b67f0da9d8275ea5d6ad17394370ee9f3
#. default-sha256: a20a93f8794d3899b34ca49a7ce510064bd735599539b43adb05ee2a0f75b7dc
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_624A38E4_B8E8_4A96_8D5F_55C759B15018"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...Why not? ⟪k:1⟫You have every right to take revenge.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫For what that man did... "
"⟪k:4⟫he ⟪k:5⟫deserves⟪k:6⟫ punishment!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...Pourquoi pas ? ⟪k:1⟫Vous avez toutes les raisons de prendre votre revanche.⟪k:2⟫ Pour ce "
"qu’il vous a fait... ⟪k:3⟫cet homme ⟪k:4⟫mérite⟪k:5⟫ un châtiment !"

#: scenario5:scenario5_5C1270ED_BD5C_428B_81E0_586D7F55FFAE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 93be03f86cdc6178da507afc74efef4810bd3a661b15d630422f98d57fd0b56d
#. default-sha256: 06a13448b390efb9224450056265a0f904090d1533858c32788d3e09d2a61ec1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5C1270ED_BD5C_428B_81E0_586D7F55FFAE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He inflicted so much pain on you!⟪k:1⟫You’re still shaking, more than a year later!⟪k:2⟫And "
"you can just let him get away with it out of the goodness of your heart?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il vous a fait tellement souffrir !⟪k:1⟫Vous en tremblez encore, plus d’un an après !⟪k:2⟫Et "
"vous arrivez à le laisser s’en tirer ainsi, juste par bonté de cœur ?!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8E94E79F_2A1D_44E4_A18A_1F6E16E386F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc8377233b799f0e16c5e319f11ae48e8186a702a9a2f5f23b0c938fe2f27c9b
#. default-sha256: 77861f320b92882c92768ca022134b45d912e9ece7f660d4279ff8e7be420972
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8E94E79F_2A1D_44E4_A18A_1F6E16E386F5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hypothetically!⟪k:2⟫ If you wanted to curse him, I—!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫En théorie !⟪k:2⟫ Si vous voulez le maudire, je—!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_00B4C34E_7151_4532_9C5B_7DD2F18BBA71
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc924ecb850ff5d309a1d8c31f9a11198b99199b9ca902527b41356958a7ee6f
