msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Si les malédictions ⟪k:1⟫existaient⟪k:2⟫, et s’il en mourait,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_2C03D6B1_1EBA_4090_BF12_97222E38BB16
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3f69f88b4e10f8b019a8da0d47456e4b424e884a36237eb6c3d0047fabe0d50f
