msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫then I would never, ⟪k:1⟫ever⟪k:2⟫ be able to forget.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫If my resentment for him took "
"his life,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫alors je ne pourrais jamais, ⟪k:1⟫plus jamais⟪k:2⟫ oublier.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫S’il perdait la vie à "
"cause de mon ressentiment,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_85FC680D_8E14_48B2_86A4_3B629B5E75F2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7c78ed19fe436855f75b335550a034296a2db2b899f2d2da9f55be80bf3898b0
#. default-sha256: 6ad08fc888e0d25e31e9f02cfd8805c696b33dbcdc3d962ee189688acd03c3d9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_85FC680D_8E14_48B2_86A4_3B629B5E75F2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫that would mean he had damaged me so permanently I was never able to get past it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫cela signifierait qu’il m’a atteint si durablement que je n’ai jamais pu m’en remettre."

#: scenario5:scenario5_9EED34B2_7659_48AF_BCF1_63E3BC12D403
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f30c3ef323c27be68161ddf5708bdfb59d77fbd73013d26e9168c29d8265eb60
#. default-sha256: f8a9044533d7f281cce1633d90ac27c91a5b1b4320d4fd4dc8fce605dc54b65c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9EED34B2_7659_48AF_BCF1_63E3BC12D403"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I don’t want that.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I ⟪k:3⟫want⟪k:4⟫ to be able to forget."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ce n’est pas ce que je veux.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Je ⟪k:3⟫veux⟪k:4⟫ pouvoir oublier."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5CC8AFD9_1813_4A01_8031_92E27EFF7280
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 844ca7f69371639a3e2e996f0627c19b582f7cd2495ff16c30cd6763f1382b8e
#. default-sha256: 67088b6f3169a5836cb953c3f6b94c9f4860fa8e0e2ee2dab8181cb09cbb3ad9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5CC8AFD9_1813_4A01_8031_92E27EFF7280"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’m still shaking now...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but one day, I want to be able to proclaim,⟪k:3⟫proudly, "
"that it no longer has any control over me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫J’en tremble encore aujourd’hui...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫...mais un jour, je veux pouvoir proclamer,⟪k:3⟫"
"fièrement, qu’il n’a plus aucun contrôle sur moi."

