"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫But I appreciate the sentiment.⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫Setting aside your choice of method..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Mais j’apprécie votre geste.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫"
"Si l’on met de côté vos méthodes..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_EBDC2BF5_6E78_45FB_BA22_EBA0A010DB03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7c142f3509e2343f808800e7678c712e63ba1b780c23cf5f0154d1b094f615c7
#. default-sha256: 9a16885c19e1e8c2dbe84a5ab0f72703e5e7c6d57e79d7f8eb36f665c0a98ee6
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_EBDC2BF5_6E78_45FB_BA22_EBA0A010DB03"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫you asked out of concern, and that’s more than enough for me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...vous avez agi parce que vous vous souciez de moi et cela me suffit amplement."

#: scenario5:scenario5_297134E5_8E5B_45E6_BE7F_EE96BEC739E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 202c667ecbcd53e81a04a379f0a0be1ba87c8c3510aa1ff195c3925a7b32c4df
#. default-sha256: 329cfb7e24f127c2ab0a2a2208603bd2660306a6874b787b4036851a052dd11f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_297134E5_8E5B_45E6_BE7F_EE96BEC739E1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A soft smile spread across her lips, but all it inspired in me was powerlessness."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Un léger sourire traversa ses lèvres mais il me laissa impuissant."

#: scenario5:scenario5_3A092EBD_F1E9_47E8_AFE9_5459AD2E4A21
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 62e570da606f4cdf44cfe01a9366a341425a24021843971d56ca065c8c552cac
#. default-sha256: a9335a3a31c339650fa56d244b5b4ac39c02cf95bb16f0cd80c9688f0ff02a2f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3A092EBD_F1E9_47E8_AFE9_5459AD2E4A21"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was putting on an act. ⟪k:1⟫Was the sentiment really “more than enough”?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Son jeu était forcé. ⟪k:1⟫Mon geste seul suffisait-il vraiment « amplement » ?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_033764A7_4DD9_4F33_B798_CC908375A9FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 69a72f472649420a88ae306f262acdbf375929e707ec1fef0f68988f5b731a06
#. default-sha256: dec5cc1bdb177907252a0d2d6e147fe3111358ca59535032640d8294b4f3ea67
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_033764A7_4DD9_4F33_B798_CC908375A9FE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Of course not. ⟪k:1⟫Not when she was still trembling so much.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫But what was I to do?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Bien sûr que non. ⟪k:1⟫Pas quand elle tremblait à ce point.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Mais que pouvais-je y "
"faire ?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7630CDDD_D507_4DDC_9DE5_AB55970B9303
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f6caef1b1bf97603f3d0948c13747bccfde31239c4c540a1d86e231c5390726c
#. default-sha256: 19b2a9bcad9a467038453ce2426aeeea589c4bcb700deddd8ae436ad4ab30451
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7630CDDD_D507_4DDC_9DE5_AB55970B9303"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What was I—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫unable to leave this house and helpless against the will of the "
"Bollingers—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫to do?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Que pouvais-je faire,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ sans pouvoir quitter la maison ni contrecarrer les plans des "
"Bollinger ?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_3248D2FD_049C_445F_88A2_65E1956C5FEA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db5f507299af1afcfba6dd901fe88f3da1f49efd6d0d240ae09e57ef6832a7cc
