#: scenario5:scenario5_232D359C_1C5A_4F53_8E21_FC2C227271B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9be3345fe783716816b955721f0da9d99d8795cc682e12d3503fe3bbb9128f95
