msgid "⟪k:0⟫So, starting now, I was going to try and support her too."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Alors, à partir de maintenant, j’allais faire de mon mieux pour la soutenir à mon tour."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C4C08CE0_0F08_4366_9844_C416D3DD103A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 88696c837e789ac99c34d2dc9e977b4a446c33b417007dfe7f8e0f6c7d2dfb18
