msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C4C08CE0_0F08_4366_9844_C416D3DD103A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was sure I would mess something up, as I had little experience being caring. ⟪k:1⟫I would "
"probably anger her, probably stress her out, and probably make her cry."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫J’allais faire des erreurs, j’en étais sûr, vu mon manque d’expérience à prendre soin des "
"autres. ⟪k:1⟫Il était fort probable que je la mette en colère, que je la mette sur les nerfs, que "
"je la fasse pleurer."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5C27C276_20FF_47C7_BBF5_1D013ADE1DD5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
